---
version: 2
id: tool-catalog
requires: [tools]
---
@if nonempty(tools)
## Your Tools
These are the tools available to YOU. Call them by populating the `calls` array with an entry whose `tool_name` is the tool and whose `args` matches the schema below.
@for tool in tools
### `{{tool.name}}`
{{tool.description}}
#### Args
@if nonempty(tool.arguments)
@for argument in tool.arguments
@if nonempty(argument.itemType)
@if argument.required
- `{{argument.name}}` ({{argument.type}}<{{argument.itemType}}>, required): {{argument.description}}
@else
- `{{argument.name}}` ({{argument.type}}<{{argument.itemType}}>, optional): {{argument.description}}
@endif
@else
@if argument.required
- `{{argument.name}}` ({{argument.type}}, required): {{argument.description}}
@else
- `{{argument.name}}` ({{argument.type}}, optional): {{argument.description}}
@endif
@endif
@endfor
@else
Pass an empty JSON object: `{}`.
@endif
#### Result formats
@for format in tool.formats
- `{{format.id}}`: {{format.description}}.
@endfor
@if nonempty(tool.documentation.behavior)
#### Behavior
{{tool.documentation.behavior}}
